*.egg-info/
dist/
build/

# Local handoff doc — not for the repo
TAKEOVER_BRIEFING.md

# ── Secret isolation (Dentatus attestation perimeter) ───────────────────────
# DENTATUS_SERVER_SECRET (the HMAC attestation key) must NEVER be committed.
# It is read from the environment only; these patterns block every common leak path.
.env
.env.*
*.env
secrets/
secret/
*.secret
*.secret.*
*secret*.txt
*secret*.json
*.key
*.pem
*.pfx
*.p12
id_rsa*
*credentials*
dentatus_secret*
DENTATUS_SERVER_SECRET*
Game1/__pycache__/

# bridge runtime artifacts (ephemeral session / command logs; may carry world/session data)
Game1/*.session
Game1/cmdlog*.json
*.attest.log
